      'description' => 'A schedule defines a repeating time period used to describe a regularly occurring <a class="localLink" href="https://schema.org/Event">Event</a>. At a minimum a schedule will specify <a class="localLink" href="https://schema.org/repeatFrequency">repeatFrequency</a> which describes the interval between occurrences of the event. Additional information can be provided to specify the schedule more precisely.
